tyle=\"cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom:2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color)\">Neutral to</span></span></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"> (x1)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Blunt\" title=\"Damage\">Blunt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Slash\" title=\"Damage\">Slash</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Pierce\" title=\"Damage\">Pierce</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Fire\" title=\"Damage\">Fire</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Frost\" title=\"Damage\">Frost</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Lightning\" title=\"Damage\">Lightning</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Poison\" title=\"Damage\">Poison</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immune\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle toccolours\" style=\"float: none;\"><span title=\"x0\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom:2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color)\">Immune to</span></span></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"> (x0)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Spirit\" title=\"Damage\">Spirit</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Stagger\" title=\"Stagger\">Stagger</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Chop\" title=\"Damage\">Chop</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Pickaxe\" title=\"Damage\">Pickaxe</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Deathsquitos</b> are aggressive <a href=\"/wiki/Creatures\" title=\"Creatures\">creatures</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/Plains\" title=\"Plains\">Plains</a>. They are, as their name suggests, enlarged mosquito-type bugs that give off a loud buzzing noise. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"e