a-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Type\n</th>\n<th>Limit\n</th>\n<th>Frequency\n</th>\n<th>Stars\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Spawn_zones\" title=\"Spawn zones\">Anywhere</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Plains\" title=\"Plains\">Plains</a>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>Uncommon\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Attacks_and_abilities\">Attacks and abilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeathsquito%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div role=\"note\" data-nosnippet=\"\" class=\"notice hatnote\">For strategies for defeating Deathsquitos, see <a href=\"/wiki/Aggressive_creature_strategies#Deathsquito\" title=\"Aggressive creature strategies\">Aggressive creature strategies §&#160;Deathsquito</a>.</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sting\">Sting</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeathsquito%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Lunges forward to stab the player with their proboscis (90 <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_types#Pierce\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage types\">Pierce</a> damage). This hits in a 1.6-meter 60-degree horizontal arc. It can use this attack every 10 seconds when 1.5 meters from a player.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDeathsquito%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"d956dd5fb64157aea32fc83b55de9049\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"DeathSquito-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:139px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File: